# Synthetic consumer fixture for isolated qualification (scripts/qualify_packs.py
# unions each pack against only its own ontology.ttl plus this opt-in fixture,
# never a sibling pack's real ontology.ttl).
#
# mp:PackMaturityPack (ontology.ttl) asserts mp:closesCapability against
# l5p:cap03/cap04/cap09 -- real, admitted facts typed for real at
# packs/mfw-pcp-level5-pack/ontology.ttl (l5p:cap01..cap12 a l5p:Capability).
# Found by scripts/check_cross_pack_references.py (RC2 lint, added after
# packs/standing-ladder-pack's own instance of this exact defect class, see
# PR #21/#22). This pack currently ships no gates/ directory at all, so this
# fixture's near-term value is satisfying the new lint -- worth noting, not
# blocking: nothing in this pack's own contract yet queries these objects'
# existence at qualification time.
@prefix l5p: <http://ggen.org/l5-promotion#> .

l5p:cap03 a l5p:Capability .
l5p:cap04 a l5p:Capability .
l5p:cap09 a l5p:Capability .
